    "segments": [
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 6,
        "sourceEnd": 92,
        "text": "Hi, Tom. Are you still coming to the repair café on Saturday? We need more volunteers.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "24883252f74f9ecf895854ca2d0336df7ab1bdaa4bcc20572819e952e907ff64",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 98,
        "sourceEnd": 214,
        "text": "I think so, but I have to check my schedule. My sister is visiting, so I might need to pick her up from the station.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "e83481c64fd4365cbd7627ff311da1034ea4a065eee667d53ab7a38d84e1e273",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 221,
        "sourceEnd": 317,
        "text": "That’s fine. The café runs from ten to four, so you could come for just two hours if that helps.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "b4eb7ba46ce3c2db80fcb0a6fc0ecf8ddeac9553876dfb2bd49f34bcfb0558c2",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 323,
        "sourceEnd": 365,
        "text": "Good. What kind of things do people bring?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "dc7e9b5abfd0c18390a77ff4333f4c95432d5518543289655f64f8923501733c",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 372,
        "sourceEnd": 513,
        "text": "Mostly small electrical items—lamps, kettles, that sort of thing. Last month we fixed twenty-three items, and we only had to throw away four.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "db1a7a22ca15ca6aefbba036f83623f6f6e19c8f31f2633240571c5b318871a9",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 519,
        "sourceEnd": 563,
        "text": "That’s impressive. Do you have enough tools?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "76bdf65a01e6aba0b37b06ad64c31ee1055feac7c2bca1ee3550b7ec77eb8ed5",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 570,
        "sourceEnd": 745,
        "text": "We do now. A local shop donated a full set of screwdrivers and a multimeter. But we’re short of people who can sew. If you know anyone who can repair clothes, please ask them.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "ad4ef77257255aab3ee1763a0af3403045652f69c2370e2a6f56bf79617e9a33",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 751,
        "sourceEnd": 836,
        "text": "I’ll ask my neighbour. She’s very good with a sewing machine. By the way, is it free?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "2c9f0e5b35f98ae5dd10066b4ffb9c2bca866d6bd309b4646a8851c6b6265afb",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 843,
        "sourceEnd": 955,
        "text": "Yes, it’s completely free, although we welcome donations. We suggest two pounds per item, but nobody has to pay.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "cd29212355145b5ca42fbddc5fa5d8269058c38f20556bb50047b2f0267059a0",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 961,
        "sourceEnd": 985,
        "text": "And where is it exactly?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "e437bf248cb6deb808ee304ce8d1983770faab882124ba6275ee31248a04767a",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 992,
        "sourceEnd": 1103,
        "text": "In the community hall on Mill Road—the one next to the library. Not the church hall. People often confuse them.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "e2809c36c4f2c878fb52205eb4a3b336022131a9f46aacf8c6ac2564d4bd061c",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 1109,
        "sourceEnd": 1187,
        "text": "Right. I went to the church hall for a meeting once. It’s easy to mix them up.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "ac417058a53bc11b095626a8b368da6154f8a819799062be12cd1be4c1516d57",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 1194,
        "sourceEnd": 1366,
        "text": "Exactly. Oh, and one more thing: if you bring your own item to repair, please label it with your name. We had a mix-up last time because two people brought identical lamps.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "23e2a1b973eac541debcfc59f9537cebeb44e39bd0b857634f8cf104deaae259",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 1372,
        "sourceEnd": 1410,
        "text": "Good to know. So, shall I come at ten?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "eb0dbf14be83dbcb41a41ae2e79231022c196b92851262ce4320b4811ca09ad5",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 1417,
        "sourceEnd": 1511,
        "text": "Actually, could you come at half past nine? We need help setting up the tables before we open.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "746493b36fb0af60bf4c69a9673fd8d680669c37b9014a0288452f71c4e91ce1",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 1517,
        "sourceEnd": 1587,
        "text": "No problem. I’ll be there at nine thirty. Do I need to bring anything?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "4592ddc28bbbff612ed8c8ae61732fb85a8a25e289c469e7ec32a3b6f2c961b7",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 1594,
        "sourceEnd": 1672,
        "text": "Just yourself. We provide tea and biscuits, so you don’t need to bring snacks.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "4a857caca4a51711435fa7a5d66b2a0b7c0cb30f350077f162625939ca54e0d1",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 1678,
        "sourceEnd": 1704,
        "text": "Perfect. See you Saturday.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "4473234d0c990718b3a2ed02e7640f76b6009a40bec30dcd36a13f4cae585d45",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      }
    ]
  },
